OL,3,GNEWSABluetongue restriction zone
OL,4,Aextension a 'positive thing' for
OL,5,Afarmers
OL,6,
OL,7,FBluetongue was first detected on farms
OL,8,Fin south-west Scotland in August and
OL,9,Fthere have now been more than 100
OL,10,Finfected animals in 41 locations,
OL,11,Fincluding four outside the original
OL,12,Frestriction zone.
